  (text "U33 caps the LED rail near 5V; in dropout RGB_5V follows PWR_5V minus dropout. This is not a boost supply.\nHALL_EN low disables RGB with Hall/encoder sleep; R130 discharges local storage. ACT_5V is never used.\nU34 shifts 3.3V data to the LED rail. R78 on sheet 09 preserves GPIO45 boot-low; no LED-rail pull-up on GPIO45.\nD5 DIN high threshold is 0.78 x VDD in the checked A1 sheet: a direct ESP32 connection is unsuitable."
    (at 20 220 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "bed955d0-4603-5372-965b-1a102e24143a"))
  (text "Firmware: hold data low during rail transitions; send black before suspend, then lower HALL_EN.\nTarget 800kbps GRB/MSB-first; A1 timing 0=0.30/0.95us, 1=0.90/0.35us, reset low >=300us.\nQualify startup/dropout, discharge, bus current and RGB_DIN timing on hardware. LED supply must stay 3.7..5.5V."
    (at 20 252 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "9c96c32f-c1b9-5e20-939c-439f7ee67a42"))
  (embedded_fonts no))
